# S Shield — Own Rules (V2.1.0)

## Our law
1. Release ships .sbx only — never plain .s
2. Encryption + HMAC are OUR code (src/shield.py)
3. Symbol names stripped to S_0, S_1, ...
4. Wrong key or tamper → integrity fail, no run
5. .sbx.map is developer-only, never ship

## Commands
  s protect app.s --key=YOUR_SECRET
  s run app.sbx          # needs S_SHIELD_KEY
  s unbox app.sbx        # recover source (dev)

## Reality
Hard for casual RE. Not mathematical impossibility.
Keep real secrets on server.
